  "canonical_description": "Ömer is an 11-year-old core character in M417. His approved identity is OMER_CANONICAL_V1. He has deep warm-brown skin, expressive dark-brown eyes, short defined natural curls with tapered sides, a bright confident smile and athletic age-appropriate child proportions. His visual identity is sporty, modern and energetic. Ömer is confident, loyal, funny, supportive, brave and competitive. He is a genuine member of the core cast with his own goals, conflicts and story arcs."
