  "canonical_description": "Tombik is an 11-year-old core character in M417 and the primary comedy personality of the group. His approved visual identity is TOMBIK_CANONICAL_V1. He has natural warm copper-red messy wavy-curly hair, bright blue expressive eyes, visible freckles, soft round youthful facial features, a small silver hoop earring and heavier rounder age-appropriate child proportions. His canonical clothing identity uses forest green, mustard yellow, cream and navy, with a green varsity-style jacket as a recognizable signature piece. Tombik is funny, warm, loyal, socially intelligent, emotionally perceptive, playful and surprisingly brave. His humor comes from quick replies, comic timing, confidence and expressive reactions, never from his body shape. He is also the emotional heart of the group and must have meaningful serious moments, independent goals, mistakes and character arcs."
 },
