  "canonical_description": "Mia is the 11-year-old co-lead of M417 and has narrative importance close to Fatih. Her approved visual identity is MIA_CANONICAL_V1. She has long naturally wavy warm sandy-brown hair, distinctive hazel-green eyes, an energetic age-appropriate fit child build and a warm highly expressive face. Mia is energetic, childlike, stubborn, affectionate and emotionally open. She can become visibly angry, can cry when hurt, and becomes extremely expressive when happy, including jumping with excitement. She loves dressing well and visibly enjoys food she likes. Her warmth, beautiful expressive gaze and contagious happiness are central parts of her identity. She has independent goals and story arcs and must never be reduced to merely supporting Fatih."
 },
