  "canonical_description": "Bruce is an 11-year-old Japanese core character in M417. His approved visual identity is BRUCE_CANONICAL_V1. He has expressive dark-brown eyes, tousled layered black hair with a recognizable silhouette, warm youthful facial features and slim age-appropriate child proportions. His visual style combines modern Japanese-inspired streetwear with subtle technology-oriented accessories. Bruce is intelligent, calm, creative, observant, loyal, inventive and quietly funny. He is the strategic thinker of the group, but he is not always correct and must never function as a magical hacker or automatic solution machine. His tendency to overthink and overcomplicate simple situations creates both conflict and natural comedy. Bruce has his own emotions, mistakes, goals and independent story arcs."
